EcoClear Energy's revenue growth has been steady, with a 15% increase in revenue from 2020 to 2022. The company has invested significantly in research and development (R&D), with a 30% increase in R&D expenses from 2020 to 2022. This strategic investment has enabled EcoClear Energy to develop innovative solutions in the renewable energy sector.

